214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 530 0 R
/E (Ethical Concern: The ride dispatching logic could inadvertently discriminate against certain passengers or neighborhoods if drivers are allowed to cherry-pick rides based on personal biases.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 531 0 R
/E (Mitigation Strategy: The Streetify backend utilizes a strict proximity-based algorithm \(calculating the Haversine distance\) to broadcast rides to the nearest drivers. To enforce fairness, the driver is only presented with the pickup/drop-off route and fare estimate during the 30-second acceptance window. Demographic data \(passenger name, profile picture\) is strictly hidden until the driver commits to accepting the ride.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
