219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 533 0 R
/E (Mitigation Strategy: Our UI/UX design prototype adheres to WCAG \(Web Content Accessibility Guidelines\) principles. We enforce a high-contrast color scheme \(Navy Blue on Soft Ash/White\). Critical driver touch targets \(such as "Mark Arrived" and "Start Trip" buttons\) are designed extra-large to minimize cognitive load and distraction while driving.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
